  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He meets Liu Wen Wu and Mo Shi Kuang at an inheritance site, clears it with them, and becomes their sworn brother. Talk names him Mo Shi Kuang’s second brother, a transformation path expert at rank four peak stage with rank five battle strength, and credits him with killing a rank five alliance leader in an earlier fight by crossing realms.",
      "chapters": [
        525
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_liu_wen_wu",
        "char_mo_shi_kuang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He is tall and skinny, with a bald head.",
      "chapters": [
        526
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When he uses rank five asura zombie Gu, his teeth grow longer and sharper like swords, and two pairs of canine teeth protrude like fangs. Green hair grows from his bald head and all over his body. His tall and skinny body becomes even thinner. His eyes turn into eerie cold green eyes that give off a glossy jade light. Wounds bleed eerie green blood.",
      "chapters": [
        526
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zombie-transformation-against-bian-si-xuan",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_green"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Hei tribe he uses rank five asura zombie Gu, a classic transformation path zombie Gu, then the killer move asura transformation. In one day of fighting he slaughters five rank four Gu Masters and twelve rank three elders.",
      "chapters": [
        526
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "asura-zombie-and-asura-transformation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "gu_asura_zombie_gu",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With Liu Wen Wu and Mo Shi Kuang he forms the killer move three heads six arms, a twenty foot bronze giant whose three heads match the three brothers. After that fight he still hunts Fang Yuan under the Chang Shan Yin name and activates asura transformation again, but cannot match Fang Yuan’s flying while the wolf group keeps slaughtering Liu tribe lines.",
      "chapters": [
        534
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-heads-six-arms-and-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_chang_shan_yin",
        "fac_liu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Liu Wen Wu, Ouyang Bi Sang, and Mo Shi Kuang deplete their primeval essence, Liu tribe collapses, and Hei tribe captures Liu Wen Wu and the others alive for reparations rather than killing them.",
      "chapters": [
        535
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "three-heads-six-arms-and-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The fan translation writes Ouyang Bi Sang and titles a chapter Asura Ouyang. No Chinese characters for the personal name appear in the English chapter text used here.",
      "chapters": [],
